<title>FINLAND: Konecranes 1996 profit rises 54 percent.</title>
<headline>Konecranes 1996 profit rises 54 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			 208.2 vs 135.3</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   9.26 vs 6.33</p>
<p> Net sales					2,450.9 vs 2,182.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				 207.7 vs 141.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecasts for Finnish cranes maker KCI Konecranes International Oy was for a 188 million markka profit</p>
<p> Depreciation					56.3 vs 55.3</p>
<p> Operating profit after depreciation	207.7 vs 141.2</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 0.4 vs 5.8 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						 69.1 vs 40.3</p>
<p> Net profit					 139.0 vs 95.0</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
